Muite
$cards
DECK 2 {SPADES, CLUBS}

$initial
DRAW 30 DEAL EHUID
EHUID 0 FACE_ALL
EHUID 4 FACE_ALL
EHUID 5 FACE_ALL
EHUID 10 FACE_ALL
EHUID 3 FACE_ALL

$moves
MOVE EHUID EHUID
DEST Size <= 5
MOVE_STACK EHUID EHUID
OR
    DESTSRC Suit alternate_color
    AND
        SRC Rank K
        SRCSTACK Rank descending
$win
PILE ALL EHUID Empty
